## Deploy

```bash
# 1 — Initialise providers and modules
terraform init

# 2 — Preview changes
terraform plan

# 3 — Apply
terraform apply
```

Expected creation times:

| Resource | Typical Duration |
|---|---|
| ODB Network + subnets | 5–10 min |
| Exadata Infrastructure | 30–60 min |
| VM Cluster | 60–120 min |

