## Outputs

After `terraform apply` completes:

```bash
terraform output odb_networks      # Network names and subnet names per instance
terraform output exadata_infras    # Infra names and OCIDs per instance
terraform output vm_clusters       # Cluster names and OCIDs per instance
terraform output db_servers        # DB Server OCIDs per cluster
```

Example:
```hcl
odb_networks = {
{% for n in networks %}
  "{{ n.module_name }}" = {
    odb_network_name   = "<resolved-at-apply>"
    client_subnet_name = "<resolved-at-apply>"
    backup_subnet_name = "<resolved-at-apply>"
  }
{% endfor %}
}
```

